cks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f772b782a760bbfa1b28","original_url":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f772b782a760bbfa1b28"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":2,"users":["U01J8RHFH3P","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IpT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72f7fef9-3751-4277-9de4-46c2f50e0f84","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"（そういえば git のチャンネルじゃない）","ts":"1631172093.391500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M9T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cac4a5fa-79d1-4da5-8d2a-6a09c7e50dbd","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"Linus 氏的には、多分コミットレベルの GPG とかは求めてないのかなと思います。勘違いかもですが。\n\u0026gt; Torvalds’ chief problem with it was that merges need “proper commit messages with information about is being merged and *why* you merge something.”\n「なぜマージしたのか」を書くべきだというのが趣旨なのかなと。\n\nそもそもコミットレベルの署名は git としても後続の機能（v1.7.9~）なのですよね。\n\nライブラリ検証とかのコンテキストで「リリースタグへの署名」は数学的に？ 保証されたものは必要でしょうけど、コミットについてそこまで厳格なものは求めていないのかなと。\n\nただ、sign-off はつけろっていうのはありますね。`git commit -s` しろと。\n\u003chttps://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v4.11/process/submitting-patches.html#sign-your-work-the-developer-s-certificate-of-origin\u003e","ts":"1631171986.390700","thread_ts":"1631171986.390700","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1631171994.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wHvp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd698c47-a0b0-4e29-a736-de910f6917c2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"やるとすると、アカウントを確実に確認できているときでS/MIMEで署名する系かなあ(そっちも不可能でない)","ts":"1631167441.382900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4day"}]},{"client_msg_id":"975123f3-0e97-4ae7-b680-ea15e5170bad","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"GitHubになるかGitHubユーザーの情報をいれる二択が自然かなあと僕も思いますが、いずれの場合もGitHub特有のcommitter情報になり、かつGPG signもGitHubのものになる時点で、Linusが欲しいものからは確実にずれそうだなという感じはします","ts":"1631166244.381600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OOvB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95ea4216-48ad-41c8-abe4-d69f47d03e87","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"特にgit amとかでの取り込みをやればわかるけど、動作と責務的にはそうですよね\nたしかにまあGitHubがcommitterだよなあ","ts":"1631165499.378800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vsfxq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa508d3f-0cd5-49ba-aa41-50ada64137b1","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"勝手な解釈ですが、\n\nauthor は言葉の通り著者で、パッチ（修正内容）の著者なのかなと思ってます。\ncommitter は言葉の通りコミットした人ということで、\n\n「このパッチを作ったのは author」 で、「取り込んだのは committer」という、\n「コードの内容」の責任と「コードを反映したこと」に対する責任を分けているのかなと思ってます。\n\nので、commit を作成した人及びシステムに責任があるということで、\nGitHub 上で commit を作った（rebase によって作られる commit を含む）ら committer は GitHub になるのが自然かなと思っています。\n（操作を実施した人は、「GitHub のボタンをポチった」ことに対する責任があり、操作履歴は GitHub 上で確認できるはずです。例えばもし GitHub システムが変な《操作実施者の意図しない》 rebase を行ったとしたら、それは操作実施者の責任ではなく、GitHub の責任になるはず、といいますか）","ts":"1631165104.377500","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1631165203.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ruk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cc77fc2-49f0-43a3-94b9-fbc4755a848d","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"ruby/rubyのコミットのSlack通知 (自前) がauthorではなくcommitterを使っているのでやたら見ることに","ts":"1631159814.368200","edited":{"user":"U01PQE8LNE9","ts":"1631159848.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A6KX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30f09429-40a7-4550-8d33-d039452b4242","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"まあgit logのデフォルトにもGitHubのUIにも出てこないんで普通は気にしないし知りもしないと思いますけど","ts":"1631159795.367600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Abp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f37664e7-f2fb-4170-8e18-94147df0bec4","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"GitHubが作ったコミットを使ってるだけなのでbotがコミットを作り直してるとかはないですね。多分GitHubがコミットする時の挙動が3つくらいあって、元のコミットがそのまま使われるパターンと、GitHubのユーザーをベースになんか意味不明なemailぽいのが勝手に作られるパターンと、単にGitHubになってしまうものがある気がします","ts":"1631159756.366900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ACrG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30758d6d-204f-49dd-a706-a67e84160915","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"GitHubがcommitterになってるとしたら、何らかのbotを動かしてるとか？","ts":"1631159573.365200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3AlM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc92bc6-26da-4074-b380-f664f1ea4bdc","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"rebase and mergeした場合はその操作をした人がcommitterになると思ってましたが、違うのかな？","ts":"1631159533.364400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lSt7W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"546c15fd-2dcd-4267-bb40-c555993c5e91","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"Pull Request の本文がコミットメッセージでこれはテンプレを用意してフォーマットを半強制してる","ts":"1631158183.361700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mHXzd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb84370b-3cd0-42a4-98ff-f19d28dbfe2c","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"Pull Request から squash した patch つくってマージしてあとでpushしてる","ts":"1631158160.361200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hx=I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74822e65-a125-4f2e-85fe-f5be114713e2","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"じぶんのOSSはPull Requestをそのままmergeしてないんですよねー","ts":"1631158125.360500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jgF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16e8532d-468c-4f49-92ce-cf06da472f03","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"それはそれとして今日も \u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1630961360258900\u003e になって、しかも今日はnvidia-driverも抜けてない状態なので直し方がわからず困りがある","ts":"1631157306.359600","thread_ts":"1631157306.359600","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 6th, 2021 1:49 PM] takashikkbn: 4K出る環境なのに、起動したらある日突然1024x768しか出なくなって厳しい","id":1,"author_id":"U01PQE8LNE9","author_name":"k0kubun","author_subname":"k0kubun","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U01PQE8LNE9","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-03-01/1802794900870_b643ce7a76e29c5365fd_48.png","text":"4K出る環境なのに、起動したらある日突然1024x768しか出なくなって厳しい","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #os-linux","ts":1630961360.258900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1630961360258900","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1630961360258900"}],"reply_count":13,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"me25"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bad183a9-c8d1-4ecb-a4cd-cabbbd5daaca","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154231347200\u003e\nruby/ruby で `git log --pretty=format:'%cn'|grep GitHub| wc -l` したら 246 だったので、まあまあそうなりますね","ts":"1631157197.358700","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 8th, 2021 7:23 PM] conao3: committerがGitHubになるのは見たことがない。。","id":1,"author_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","author_name":"Naoya Yamashita","author_subname":"Naoya Yamashita","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UDPT2BZ6E","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1a9a49807415fb97544a7383a9288b84.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0004-48.png","text":"committerがGitHubになるのは見たことがない。。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #os-linux","ts":1631154231.347200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154231347200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154231347200"}],"edited":{"user":"U01PQE8LNE9","ts":"1631157216.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qitmD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bf0b458-742b-4cd3-869a-e8b63df49cfd","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"GitHubのUI上ではauthorの方しか出ないのでcommitterがどうなってるのかはわかりませんね","ts":"1631157158.358300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EYFvQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02f64503-6c93-45ca-9bdd-fa182318255e","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154059345500\u003e\n観測していてもあまりよくわからないんですが、masterがparentの状態で積まれたコミットをPRにして、masterが更新される前にrebase and mergeでマージするとcommitterはそのままになる気がしていて、それ以外の結構多くの条件でcommitterがGitHubになるように思います。\n\n適当に直近でそうなってる奴をひっぱると、 \u003chttps://github.com/ruby/ruby/pull/4812\u003e がsquash and mergeでそうなってる奴で、 \u003chttps://github.com/ruby/ruby/pull/4739\u003e がrebase and mergeでそうなってる奴ですね。merge commit作るのはruby/rubyだとdisableされてるのであんまり普段見れてないです。","ts":"1631157135.357700","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 8th, 2021 7:20 PM] koron: commiterがGitHubになるのってどんなとき?","id":1,"author_id":"U06BRP8VD","author_name":"KoRoN","author_subname":"KoRoN","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06BRP8VD","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4b5a6f711a4e22e617b74058239ade53.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0007-48.png","text":"commiterがGitHubになるのってどんなとき?","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #os-linux","ts":1631154059.345500,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154059345500","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1631154059345500"}],"edited":{"user":"U01PQE8LNE9","ts":"1631157239.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3B/O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2028b8e9-3081-4e34-bce6-5038fb0a9bfc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"リポジトリにIssueやら突っ込めたらよかったのかもしれないけど果たしてそれがVCSの責務かというと微妙…","ts":"1631155467.354500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ytop"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6756cd5-0f1a-408b-91b5-2722e226d453","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GitHub 上だと author と committer が違う場合は2人のアイコンが重なって表示されます (FYI)","ts":"1631154652.353200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OqYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72c1c37d-a8a2-4754-8ef8-09da416feb83","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"GitHub でコミットする以上 committer は GitHub になるのが自然かなとは思います。\n\n多分 Linus 氏が言いたいのは、情報の凝集度のことかなと。\ngit リポジトリは単なるストレージにすぎないわけで、\n\n「コードの情報」という観点で、git 上で情報を管理するのが凝集度が高いというか自然といいますか。\n\nまぁ実際のところはわかりませんが。。","ts":"1631154623.352900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXfJo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b959d5e-699a-4354-95ee-d27578233212","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"commiter は\n`git log --format=full` すると見えます。author と committer があるんですよね。ご存知かもですが","ts":"1631154469.349900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hontoda","count":1,"users":["UJ70JTGR3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3QGx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b30bceef-83cb-430e-921d-901dce553877","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"マージコミットの方もIDにしてほしい","ts":"1631154347.348500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MHLJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e743f357-06eb-445b-9f41-780d51c875bc","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"自分のgit logを見るとマージコミットの方のauthorは本名で、ローカルでのコミットのauthorは.gitconfigのidになってましたけど、これのことですかね？","ts":"1631154290.348200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NIF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27e4fd15-f58b-4142-a509-fda3b319446d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"committerがGitHubになるのは見たことがない。。","ts":"1631154231.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=PIs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"491d1abc-d16a-4826-bc8b-b7b39adb4979","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"GitHubに依存しきってればPRのスレ見ろで終わりだけど、規模によってはログのベンダーロックインを避けたい、みたいなのはありそうですよね。","ts":"1631154225.347000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kwheq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77adac70-012c-4bf3-8dc6-114850920400","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"マージコミットにコメントが欲しいと思ったことがないので、何を書くんだろうと思ってますが、Linuxレベルの規模になるとマージの意図までを見れないと辛くなるんでしょうね","ts":"1631154073.345700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9E4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac5e88b8-d7ec-48c2-9712-9d033b614ea0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"commiterがGitHubになるのってどんなとき?","ts":"1631154059.345500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V6=j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21c22b44-4135-4d9e-b1f9-bb45326fc8dc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(発表直前に書き込む余裕の k0kubun さん)","ts":"1631153808.343700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u1NlN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"527e3b3c-e5ed-430c-ac95-eab6218a1708","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"committerがGitHubになり始めたのは途中からだけど、かといってGitHubユーザー情報をいれられてもsignがGitHubの奴ベースだとやはりそれも欲しいものではなさそう","ts":"1631153682.343100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DoBa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2e7a187-d678-4c63-888a-9b64b6ebd7a9","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"記事見たときはrebase and mergeならいいのかなと一瞬思ったけど、committerがGitHubになってしまうケースがまあまああるので、多分それもLinusが欲しいやつじゃないんだろうなという感じがしている","ts":"1631153572.342500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhEu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69add36b-94f7-44d0-b79e-009da6946fce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ毎回脳死で 2 回ボタンを押してしまうので存在自体を認識できてない人はいるかも、みたいなのはちょっと思いましたw","ts":"1631153546.341900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"My2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8edb69ed-596b-40e5-9cbd-6325e5c74a2a","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"おお…ありがとうございます。GitHub を不要に dis っていた。。","ts":"1631153505.341100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dOtA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9104490f-9aaa-40d6-92d2-5dbc4e72ce24","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"マージ押した時に、まずメッセージ編集用のテキストボックスが出てきて、更にボタン押さないとマージできないはずです","ts":"1631153477.340600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gb70E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d2e618e-9cef-4dfe-8484-9b7f7fe35502","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"できるはずです。…個人的にやったことはないんですが","ts":"1631153452.339700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+u3fl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce221fc3-4387-44cf-8002-939c911761c4","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あれ。ごめんなさい勘違いかもです。\nマージに対するコメントではなく、マージコミット自体を編集できましたっけ。","ts":"1631153437.339400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xA7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5782f197-8733-401c-9594-337f0943885b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GitHub がマージコミットを編集させないってのはなんの話だろう。実際に編集することがあるかはともかく、マージする時に編集テキストボックス出てきますよね","ts":"1631153365.338700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G1qw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b3c3b6b-6d36-49f1-a7df-317c9b5313f5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ずっと前からありますね","ts":"1631153327.338000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8uiC9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"deb3064e-0b7b-4513-b2a7-87185adf2de9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"マジかー","ts":"1631153054.337100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bbg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38aee89a-030f-40b8-8614-3651ee79a9e6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"昔からというのは感覚なのでわからないですが、leafを作った頃、2018年くらいのときはもうあったと思います","ts":"1631153046.336900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81a1fb04-acb4-4592-91ff-4d14e383c7eb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"脳死だったけど、これできるならなんで運用ルールがこうなってるんだろう","ts":"1631152995.336200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3f0F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfb05280-3ff6-43b9-9f7f-9f0fa957d5f2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ昔からあります？","ts":"1631152958.334500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EAdC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e886a2ab-6403-4af1-9134-d0fb6371ed51","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"vim/vimで例示しようと思ったらvimはPR運用してないので例示できなかった","ts":"1631152953.334400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mLg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed591cbc-7b6e-4fd5-91d4-dfb6edc5d61e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"え、今飛べるんだ・・・","ts":"1631152940.333900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7aoBD"}]},{"client_msg_id