alse,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_tiny":"AwAWADDSNRmUKQGBGRT2OASe1JvXAJOM9M0AMEwIJwccUeenofyp4dCcBhRuX1FACCVS+0fnSGZR6/lT+CKWgAIzwelBGeuKWigBNo9B+VG36UtFACYoxS0UAf/Z","username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4C9+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c5d444e-603f-4a83-9949-fb3e2836335a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"コミットにPR番号入れなくてもそのコミットが入ったPRはすぐ飛べませんか？\n（GitHubのページを見に行くのが面倒とか言う話でしょうか？）","ts":"1631152884.331600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/rbNX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1723096-a17a-4ac6-84b9-75d497860038","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今考えるとこれgit (filter-repo)自体にPythonのランタイムが入ってる？","ts":"1631152842.330800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3uW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ba3a3d2-53bd-44b8-9550-f713e9658d47","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"マージにコメント書けるので、そこちゃんとしないよなとは思うけど。\nまあ言ってることはまっとうなのでそこはいいか","ts":"1631152826.330300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Qat"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02c96f90-1abc-46d4-8d30-f00c30610222","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"UI は文化をつくるという観点で、\nGitHub ほどのところがマージコミットの編集をさせないというのは、個人的に微妙だなぁと思ってます。\n\nローカルでマージして push する形でも GitHub のプルリクを更新できるので、個人的にそうすることもあったり","ts":"1631152744.329400","thread_ts":"1631152744.329400","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1631152801.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"coybh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e49bc72-5353-4242-b717-298613d6ddb9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"面倒だったんで以前こういうの書いてメモしました\n\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/yyano/PR%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%ABcommit_comment%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3\u003e","ts":"1631152708.328900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yuki Yano's project: PR作成後にcommit commentの一括修正 - Yuki Yano's project","id":1,"title":"PR作成後にcommit commentの一括修正 - Yuki Yano's project","title_link":"https://scrapbox.io/yyano/PR%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%ABcommit_comment%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3","text":"一括でprefixを追加してコミットメッセージを GH-{num}: message に変更する。 git filter-branch でもできるはずだけど、非推奨なので git filter-repo を使う。 --message-callback はPythonでコードが書けてちょっと長くなるけど便利 code:add_pr_num_prefix $ git filter-repo --for","thumb_url":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/content-logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yuki Yano's project","service_icon":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":288,"thumb_height":288,"from_url":"https://scrapbox.io/yyano/PR%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%ABcommit_comment%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3","original_url":"https://scrapbox.io/yyano/PR%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%ABcommit_comment%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%AC%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ufXd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61c56dd2-e81b-4d03-8552-170b2e46ee29","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、 `GH-{num}:`  prefixだった","ts":"1631152690.328200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pMJJI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a82ce00-8bd1-4958-85d1-bfa288581224","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"コミットメッセージに `#{PR_number}` が入ってればGitHubの機能でジャンプできるから基本的に付けておくみたいな運用ルールがうちの業務ではあったりします","ts":"1631152617.326400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Ot"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d8b7856-337a-4cb9-b5ca-0fc2d3d66db1","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"マージコミットのコミットメッセージにまともな情報が入らないのを問題視してるのかな。","ts":"1631152461.324400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+hE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9442ea95-19ee-4e78-bdcb-2cdd80a74d66","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあLinus節","ts":"1631149292.322800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QTK4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e51cc364-9f16-4856-9212-6a5425fa1df6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でもシステムじゃなく運用でLinuxもいままで取り込んでるところあるので、その意味でGitHubに文句いうよりはGitHubを上手くつかえてないところについて問題があると思うんだけどな...","ts":"1631148887.322400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YuU4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bcb2fb5-5b25-4073-9fe6-176f0832ed82","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttp://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/2109.0/03094.html\u003e\n\u0026gt; Please pull this branch containing ntfs3 code for 5.15.\nやっぱりmerge requestじゃなくてpull requestであってたんや！って気持ちになりました","ts":"1631148404.321000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5zSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4a212b5-0173-4a54-ad8c-236ca6411aac","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"Linux kernel なんてどのみち ML もみないと背景わからないだろう、似たようなものでは、言われたら黙ります","ts":"1631148326.320000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KxOa0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a63b44f-49e8-4bf4-9a44-e22ac947be45","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"PR 本文や PR コメントの情報を参照しなくても、コミットメッセージからある程度（要定義）内容が分かる運用が好き","ts":"1631148295.319300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UBNPMJJGM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IYSx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20709e17-9a10-414c-94cf-fa6b5f677dbb","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"\u0026gt; Torvalds氏が問題視しているのは、「何がマージされようとしているか、なぜそれをマージ